      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 25:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waisraeli walipokuwa huko Shitimu, wanaume walianza kuzini na wanawake wa Moabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.25.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.25.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 25:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wanawake hao waliwaalika Waisraeli washiriki matambiko waliyotambikia miungu yao, nao Waisraeli wakala chakula na kuiabudu miungu yao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.25.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.25.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 25:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndivyo Waisraeli walivyojiunga na mungu Baali wa Peori, nayo hasira ya Mwenyezi-Mungu ikawaka dhidi yao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.25.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.25.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 25:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi, Mwenyezi-Mungu akamwambia Mose, “Wachukue viongozi wote wa Israeli, uwanyonge mbele yangu juani, ili ghadhabu yangu dhidi yenu ipite.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.25.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.25.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 25:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose akawaambia waamuzi wa Israeli, “Kila mmoja wenu amuue mtu yeyote miongoni mwenu ambaye amejiunga na mungu Baali wa Peori.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.25.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.25.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 25:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.25.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.25.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 25:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakati huohuo mtu mmoja akamleta mwanamke mmoja Mmidiani nyumbani kwake, Mose na jumuiya yote ya watu wa Israeli wakiwa wanaomboleza penye lango la hema la mkutano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.25.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.25.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 25:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi, Finehasi mwana wa Eleazari mwana wa kuhani Aroni alipoona hayo, aliinuka akatoka katika hiyo jumuiya, akachukua mkuki ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.25.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.25.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 25:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na kumfuatia yule Mwisraeli mpaka hemani, akawachoma mkuki wote wawili tumboni. Maradhi mabaya yaliyokuwa yamewaangamiza Waisraeli yakakomeshwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.25.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.25.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 25:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waliokufa kutokana na maradhi yale mabaya walikuwa watu 24,000.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.25.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.25.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 25:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.25.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.25.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 25:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi-Mungu akamwambia Mose, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.25.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.25.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 25:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Finehasi mwana wa Eleazari, mwana wa kuhani Aroni, ameizuia hasira yangu dhidi ya Waisraeli; miongoni mwenu ni yeye tu aliyeona wivu kama nilio nao mimi. Ndio maana sikuwaangamiza Waisraeli wote kwa hasira yangu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.25.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.25.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 25:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa hiyo mwambie kwamba ninafanya naye agano la amani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.25.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.25.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 25:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naagana naye kwamba yeye na wazawa wake watakuwa makuhani milele kwa sababu aliona wivu kwa ajili yangu, Mungu wake, akawafanyia upatanisho Waisraeli.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.25.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.25.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 25:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.25.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.25.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 25:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Huyo Mwisraeli aliyeuawa pamoja na mwanamke wa Kimidiani aliitwa Zimri mwana wa Salu, kiongozi wa jamaa mojawapo katika kabila la Simeoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.25.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.25.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 25:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na huyo mwanamke Mmidiani aliyeuawa aliitwa Kozbi binti Suri, aliyekuwa kiongozi wa ukoo fulani huko Midiani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.25.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.25.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
